Barak, the son of Abinoam of the tribe of Naphtali, 
was chosen by the prophetess Deborah to lead the 
Israelites against the Canaanite general Sisera. Barak 
gathered his forces and took up his position on 
Mount Tabor. Sisera’s army consisted of nine hundred 
