thorns are with you and you sit upon scorpions’ (Ezek. 
2:6). Ezekiel records that for seven days after this 
revelation he was like a man stunned. 

Another vision concerns the idolatrous practices 
which he so vehemently and constantly denounced. He 
feels that the hand of the Lord lifts him up by the hair 








