It was timely for Moses to be relieved of routine duties, 
for the Lord was about to call on him to fulfil a loftier 
purpose. The stage was set for one of the most awesome 
moments in human history: the handing down of the 
Law on Mount Sinai. 

God called Moses up to the mountain and instructed 
him to tell the Children of Israel that if they would keep 
his covenant ‘you shall be to me a kingdom of priests 
and an holy nation’ (Exod. 19:6). They were ordered to 
