literature about Jesus which existed in the Ist century 
AD. They give written form to the oral tradition of the 
infant Christian Church. This tradition was developed, 
in the speeches and writings of the Christians of the 
first generation, in order to present the story of Jesus 
to those outside the Christian community and also to 
teach those who followed Jesus to apply his teaching in 


