the Letters have a place also in the Gospel. There is a 
general affinity of theological outlook, both insisting 
on the necessity of Jesus’s coming ‘in the fiesh’, both 
speaking of judgment, forgiveness, God’s love for 
mankind, the mutual love and obedience enjoined 
