secret if he seeks to be known openly. If you do these 
things, show yourself to the world.” For even his 
brothers did not believe in him.’ (John 7:3-5) Luke, 
however, relates how Mary the mother of Jesus ‘with 
his brothers’ remained loyal in their prayers along with 
the apostles in Jerusalem after the ascension of Jesus. 

