What was his motive? 

The synoptists made no effort to analyse the motive of 
Judas. The Fourth Gospel, rather unworthily perhaps, 
simply accuses him of greed and theft, quoting Judas’s 
reaction to the anointing of Jesus by Mary of Bethany 
