people, devoid of the Spirit’. ‘These are grumblers, 
malcontents, following their own passions, loud- 
mouthed boasters, flattering people to gain advantage. 
But you must remember, beloved; the predictions of the 
apostles of our Lord Jesus Christ; they said to you, 
*‘In the last time there will be scoffers, following their 
own ungodly passions.” It is these who set up divisions, 
worldly people, devoid of the Spirit.’ (Jude 16-19) Then 
the wniter presses home his own advice, “But you, 
beloved, build yourselves up on your most holy faith; 
pray in the Holy Spirit; keep yourselves in the love of 
God; wait for the mercy of our Lord Jesus Christ unto 
eternal life.’ (Jude 20-21) 

