affection towards sinners. Luke shows clearly Jesus’s 
neighbourliness and his respect for foreigners in the 
parable of the Good Samaritan, and his concern for 
the outcasts and the poor in the parable of the Rich 
Man and Lazarus, the healing of the Ten Lepers, the 
story of Zacchaeus, and the parable of the Pharisee and 
