rival emperor. Finding only Jason himself, they drag- 
ged him before the city council, who made Jason pay 
security before releasing him. This Jason may well be 
the relation of Paul mentioned in his letter to the 
Romans. 

Under cover of dark, Paul and Silas escaped to 
Beroea, again travelling westward along the highway. 
Perhaps the fact that Paul’s stay among the Thessa- 
