spirit, and those who worship him must worship in 
spirit and truth.’ (John 4:21, 24) 

The woman still did not understand him and, expect- 
ing an obscure answer perhaps from such a prophet, 
she looked forward to the coming of the Christ who, 
when he came, would make it all plain. ‘I know that 
Messiah is coming (he who is called Christ); when he 
comes, he will show us all things.’ (John 4:25) Im- 
